  "term": "IEP",
  "definition": "In school psychology and special education, IEP stands for Individualized Education Program. In the packet, it is the process or plan developed after Child Find referral, parental consent, and comprehensive assessment, with an IEP meeting used to determine a student’s eligibility, goals, services, accommodations, and placement under IDEA.",
